LanguageData.VGE_Warplatform.description:
An orbital bombardment platform has detected your Hellion signature and will engage shortly.

Time until arrival: {0}

Move away before it locks in to avoid it, or prepare to fight it.

LanguageData.VGE_SalvagerStation.description:
A salvager orbital station is demanding a tribute of {0} silver or it will open fire.

Time until tribute needs to be paid: {1}

You can ask them to postpone the payment, but the Hellion engine will be locked remotely until the tribute is paid or the station is defeated. You can also pay immediately if you have the funds. Running away will likely cause the salvagers to send a search party after you.

LanguageData.VGE_EnemyGravjumper.description:
An enemy Hellion Fighter is locking in and will engage shortly.

Time until arrival: {0}

Move away before it arrives to avoid it, or prepare to fight it.

LanguageData.VGE_OrbitalCluster.description:
A US Automated Aerospace Defense battery has locked onto your position and will attack soon.

Time until arrival: {0}

Moving away will likely delay the attack, but sooner or later an orbital defense battery must be defeated to stop the threat.

LanguageData.VGE_EnemyGravship.description:
An enemy Hellion is preparing the bombardment and will engage shortly.

Time until arrival: {0}

Move away before it arrives to avoid it, or prepare to fight it.
